  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(14 ÷ 7) × [8 + {3 + 8 - 2}] - (5 - 2)\n\nConcept Used:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/c49e9ef184ad3a244b4a0e325f1c03fdf73a234e5d04e86e969336de19771c93.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ (14 ÷ 7) × [8 + {3 + 8 - 2}] - (5 - 2)\n\n⇒ (2) × [8 + {11 - 2}] - (3)\n\n⇒ (2) × [8 + 9] - (3)\n\n⇒ (2) × 17 - (3)\n\n⇒ 34 - (3)\n\n⇒ 31\n\n**∴ Option 2 is the correct answer.**",
